### Flight health: database and RabbitMQ
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Cargo health: database, RabbitMQ and Flight HTTP
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health

### Partner health: database and RabbitMQ
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health

### Get a development Flight planner token (run before authenticated requests)
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/air-freight/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=air-freight-dev&grant_type=password&username=flight-planner&password=password

> {%
    client.test("Token issued", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected HTTP 200");
        client.assert(!!response.body.access_token, "Expected an access token");
    });
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

### Authenticated Flight request (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/status
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Authenticated Cargo request (200)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/status
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Flight lookup by key (200 for a flight created from an SSM, 404 otherwise)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/flights/HJ221/2026-10-19/BRU
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Flight day overview (flights by UTC departure date)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/flights?date=2026-10-19
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Cargo day overview for the load planner (only planned flights; 503 when Flight is down)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/flights?date=2026-10-19
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Cargo day overview including departed and landed flights
GET http://localhost:8081/api/flights?date=2026-10-19&includeDeparted=true
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Cargo plan of one flight: flight data, status and every booked ULD with its position or null (503 when Flight is down)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/cargo-plans/HJ221/2026-10-19/BRU
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Cargo plan of a flight Flight does not know (404)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/cargo-plans/XX999/2026-10-19/BRU
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Cargo plan with an invalid flight key (400)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/cargo-plans/HJ-221/2026-10-19/BRU
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Anonymous Flight request (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/status

### Anonymous Cargo request (401)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/status

### Get a development Load planner token
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/air-freight/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=air-freight-dev&grant_type=password&username=load-planner&password=password

> {%
    client.test("Token issued", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected HTTP 200");
        client.assert(!!response.body.access_token, "Expected an access token");
    });
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

### Loading window of one flight with the load planner token: opensAt is STD - 12h, closesAt is ETD - 20m (UTC), loadingAllowed and the refusal code; 200 for every known flight
GET http://localhost:8081/api/cargo-plans/HJ221/2026-10-19/BRU/loading-window
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Loading window of a flight Flight does not know (404)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/cargo-plans/XX999/2026-10-19/BRU/loading-window
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Main-deck loading positions: 34 entries nose to tail, RL is row R LEFT and LR is row L RIGHT
GET http://localhost:8081/api/loading-positions
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Put a booked ULD on RL or move it there (204; needs an open loading window, 409 with the refusal otherwise)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/cargo-plans/HJ221/2026-10-19/BRU/bookings/AKE12345KL/position
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"position": "RL"}

### The same position again changes nothing (204)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/cargo-plans/HJ221/2026-10-19/BRU/bookings/AKE12345KL/position
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"position": "RL"}

### A second ULD on a taken position (409 naming the ULD on it; book PMC00001KL first)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/cargo-plans/HJ221/2026-10-19/BRU/bookings/PMC00001KL/position
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"position": "RL"}

### Unknown position (400)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/cargo-plans/HJ221/2026-10-19/BRU/bookings/AKE12345KL/position
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"position": "ZZ"}

### ULD not booked on this flight (404)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/cargo-plans/HJ221/2026-10-19/BRU/bookings/XXX99999XX/position
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"position": "CL"}

### Take the ULD off its position (204, also when it has none)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/cargo-plans/HJ221/2026-10-19/BRU/bookings/AKE12345KL/position
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Position change without a token (401; role checks come with #2)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/cargo-plans/HJ221/2026-10-19/BRU/bookings/AKE12345KL/position
Content-Type: application/json

{"position": "RL"}
